sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dispatcher as Dispatcher
    participant Gateway as API Gateway / Web UI
    participant Agent as LangGraph Dispatch Agent
    participant MCP as FastMCP Server
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB (farm_prod)
    participant RAG as Knowledge Engine
    actor Supervisor as Supervisor (Mobile / Web Sign-off)

    Dispatcher->>Gateway: Submit dispatch request (Equipment 3, Field 2, Job='spray', Chemical 1)
    Gateway->>Agent: Run dispatch workflow with JWT context (technician_id=1)
    Agent->>MCP: check_equipment_and_field_status(equipment_id=3, field_id=2)
    MCP->>DB: Query Equipment status, Customer credit hold, Field proximity
    DB-->>MCP: Equipment='idle', Customer credit_hold=0, Field canal proximity=10m
    MCP-->>Agent: Live DB Status

    Agent->>RAG: Check chemical compliance for Chemical 1 (Glyphosate)
    RAG-->>Agent: SOP-CHEM-4040: Restricted chemical, 15m canal buffer, requires signoff
    
    Agent->>Agent: Grounded Validator checks: Canal distance 10m < 15m buffer requirement!
    Agent->>Gateway: Notify Dispatcher: "Warning: Field 2 is 10m from canal. 15m buffer required. Propose low-hazard chemical or boundary adjustment."
    Dispatcher->>Gateway: Dispatcher adjusts swath & requests supervisor approval
    
    Agent->>MCP: initiate_signoff_request(dispatch_details)
    MCP->>Supervisor: Push Notification with exact chemical, field map, buffer warnings
    Supervisor-->>MCP: Sign-off Approved (Digital Signature & Notes)
    
    MCP->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    MCP->>DB: INSERT INTO Dispatch_Jobs (status='dispatched', approval_status='approved')
    MCP->>DB: UPDATE Equipment SET status='dispatched' WHERE equipment_id=3
    MCP->>DB: INSERT INTO Audit_Logs (action='dispatch_equipment', status='SUCCESS')
    MCP->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
    MCP-->>Agent: Dispatch confirmed (dispatch_id=101)
    Agent-->>Dispatcher: Final Response: "Equipment 3 successfully dispatched under approved buffer adjustment."
